---
// Quiz figure for the Backtest post: QueueSlice. Inline SVG, site tokens only, no ids.
---
<div class="qfig-atq12-queueslice">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 580 184" role="img" aria-label="A bar showing a queue of 2,000,000 shares to buy at 21,400. A sell of 50,000 shares fills only the first slice, and the new 10,000-share buy sits at the very back.">
<text x="10" y="20" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>The buy queue at 21,400</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Hàng chờ mua ở 21.400</tspan></text>
<rect x="30" y="50" width="520" height="34" rx="6" class="box" />
<rect x="30" y="50" width="517.4" height="34" rx="6" class="mutf" style="opacity:.35" />
<rect x="30" y="50" width="12.935323383084578" height="34" rx="6" class="okb" />
<rect x="547.4" y="50" width="4" height="34" class="redf" />
<text x="30" y="44" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>front</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>đầu hàng</tspan></text>
<text x="550" y="44" class="s" text-anchor="end"><tspan data-lang-en>back</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>cuối hàng</tspan></text>
<line x1="36.46766169154229" y1="86" x2="36.46766169154229" y2="116" class="ln" />
<text x="44.46766169154229" y="128" class="t13"><tspan data-lang-en>sell of 50,000 fills only this slice</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>lệnh bán 50.000 chỉ khớp phần này</tspan></text>
<line x1="546.7064676616915" y1="86" x2="546.7064676616915" y2="156" class="ln" />
<text x="538.7064676616915" y="168" class="t13" text-anchor="end"><tspan data-lang-en>your 10,000 shares, last in line</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>10.000 cổ phiếu của bạn, đứng cuối hàng</tspan></text>
  </svg>
</div>

<style>
  .qfig-atq12-queueslice { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .qfig-atq12-queueslice-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .qfig-atq12-queueslice svg { display: block; width: 100%;  height: auto; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .qfig-atq12-queueslice text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .qfig-atq12-queueslice .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-atq12-queueslice .s { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .qfig-atq12-queueslice .t13 { font-size: 13px; }
  .qfig-atq12-queueslice .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-atq12-queueslice .redt { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .qfig-atq12-queueslice .goldt { fill: var(--gold-icon); font-weight: 700; }
  .qfig-atq12-queueslice .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); }
  .qfig-atq12-queueslice .okb { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); }
  .qfig-atq12-queueslice .badb { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); }
  .qfig-atq12-queueslice .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; fill: none; }
  .qfig-atq12-queueslice .arrf { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .qfig-atq12-queueslice .ax { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; fill: none; }
  .qfig-atq12-queueslice .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; stroke-dasharray: 3 4; fill: none; }
  .qfig-atq12-queueslice .redl { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; fill: none; }
  .qfig-atq12-queueslice .goldl { stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 2; fill: none; }
  .qfig-atq12-queueslice .mutl { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; fill: none; }
  .qfig-atq12-queueslice .redf { fill: var(--red); }
  .qfig-atq12-queueslice .goldf { fill: var(--gold); }
  .qfig-atq12-queueslice .mutf { fill: var(--text-faint); }
  .qfig-atq12-queueslice .hole { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .qfig-atq12-queueslice figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
